{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Zg7Gmn5IRP1794532029.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>輝達競爭對手Cerebras第三季度業績及業績指引均好過市場預期，股價在延長交易時段一度升約兩成。</p><p></p><p>Cerebras季內虧損1.61億美元，按年擴大超過六倍。每股虧損67美仙，按年擴大六成三。核心收入增長七成，至2.3億美元，較預期多約1,600萬多美元。</p><p></p><p>預料第四季度核心收入最高3.3億美元，全年度最高9.6億美元。第四季度核心毛利率最高四成九，全年度最高四成四。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T01:53:46.818768+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T00:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T03:11:49.400574+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T01:47:00.656265+00:00","content_hash":"2502ea8ef097c2a4406b71f930fc0c9dd06ff5312fffdc851adab7ba8aa2c7ae","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T01:53:46.818768+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}